The chain is a list of 0, 1, 2, and 3.
The wanted is a list of 0, 1, and 3.
The last is the last position of chain.
The total is 0.
The inside is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The value is item spot of chain.
The prior is inside.
If wanted contains value and prior is 0, add 1 to total.
If wanted contains value, set inside to 1, otherwise set inside to 0.

Show total.
